## corpus/memory/raw_lshr_top_bits.lu
//! check: run(exit=0, stdout="33554304 1 15 31\n")
//! phase: run
//! conforms: mem.unsafe.raw.1, mem.unsafe.scope
//!
//! s214 (wolf-lang#600, P0): the same top-half branches on a plain `u64`
